"""Flux CLI — personal control plane for AI agent tooling.

This is the main entry point invoked as ``bin/flux``.  It wires together
the library modules under ``lib/`` and exposes every user-facing command
(search, add, sync, run, doctor, etc.) via argparse subcommands.
"""

